<table width="100%">
<tr>
<td width="50%" valign="top">

<h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px;">👤 About Me <a id="about"></a></h3>

<p>I'm <b>{{ profile.identity.name }}</b>, a Computer Science and Engineering graduate specializing in Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning.</p>

<p>My work spans full-stack development, REST API engineering, machine learning, and cloud infrastructure. I enjoy building practical, end-to-end systems that solve real-world problems with reliable engineering practices.</p>

</td>
<td width="50%" valign="top">

<h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px;">📊 At a Glance</h3>

{% if has(profile.identity.roles_targeted) -%}
<p style="margin: 4px 0;"><b>🎯 Target Roles:</b> {{ profile.identity.roles_targeted | join(" &nbsp;•&nbsp; ") }}</p>
{% endif -%}
{% if has(profile.identity.education) -%}
{% for edu in profile.identity.education -%}
<p style="margin: 4px 0;"><b>🎓 Degree &amp; School:</b> {{ edu.degree }} — {{ edu.school }}</p>
<p style="margin: 4px 0;"><b>🗓️ Academic Period:</b> {{ edu.start }} – {{ edu.end }}{% if has(edu.score) %} &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>CGPA {{ edu.score }}</b>{% endif %}</p>
{% endfor -%}
{% endif -%}
{% if has(profile.identity.location) -%}
<p style="margin: 4px 0;"><b>📍 Location:</b> {{ profile.identity.location }}</p>
{% endif -%}
{% if has(profile.identity.languages_spoken) -%}
<p style="margin: 4px 0;"><b>🗣️ Languages:</b> {{ profile.identity.languages_spoken | join(", ") }}</p>
{% endif -%}
{% if has(profile.identity.focus_areas) -%}
<p style="margin: 4px 0;"><b>🔬 Focus Areas:</b> {{ profile.identity.focus_areas | join(" &nbsp;•&nbsp; ") }}</p>
{% endif -%}

</td>
</tr>
</table>
